Description: Wild OS Open and Save dialog and file clash dialog
 One Open and Save dialog for every app, laid out like the one on Windows:
 places on the left, a path bar, the file list with dates, types and sizes,
 then the name and type at the bottom. It is a desktop portal backend, so
 Flatpak apps, GTK apps, browsers and Qt and KDE apps all get it.
 .
 It also asks what to do when a copy or move meets a file with the same
 name (replace, skip or keep both), for Files and, through Wild OS's KIO
 patch, for every other app that copies with KIO.
